  <item>
    <title>New York (S10642/A11560): data center moratorium — Proposed</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/new-york-s10642-a11560-ny</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-new-york-(s10642/a11560)-ny</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Responsible Data Center Development Act: 1-year moratorium on state permits for 20+ MW facilities, plus a dedicated utility rate class, a DEC impact study, and a host-community benefit program. Passed the Senate 43-17. Per the Senate&#x27;s own record it had not been delivered to the Governor as of Aug 4, 2026 — Hochul acted by executive order (EO 62, 50 MW floor) instead. Still live, and stricter than the EO</description>
  </item>
